* AV1 OBU Info
** Header
   Structured as followed:
   ~ OBU_FORBIDDEN_BIT - 1 bit
     Never set this, it is forbiddden for some reason
   ~ OBU_TYPE - 4 bits
     Indicates the type of the OBU header
     Is ignored if the decoded doesnt understand it
     So we can use it freely and possibly get video which still is playable by a noncompatible decoder
     Types can be:
   ~~ SEQ_HDR -> 1
   ~~ TD -> 2
   ~~ FRAME_HDR -> 3
   ~~ TILE_GRP -> 4
   ~~ METADATA -> 5
   ~~ FRAME -> 6
   ~~ REDUNDANT_FRAME_HDR -> 7
   ~~ PADDING -> 15


